itle=\"Delete Item (Safe)\" class=\"p-1 text-[10px] font-bold text-red-500 hover:text-red-700 cursor-pointer\">✕</button></div></div><div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\"><div><label class=\"block text-[9px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase\">Action</label><select class=\"w-full rounded border border-slate-200 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold\"><option value=\"INCLUDE\">Include (Show)</option><option value=\"EXCLUDE\">Exclude (Hide)</option></select></div><div><label class=\"block text-[9px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase\">Location Rule</label><select class=\"w-full rounded border border-slate-200 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium\"><option value=\"ENTIRE_SITE\">Entire Website</option><option value=\"FRONT_PAGE\">Homepage Only</option><option value=\"SINGULAR_POST\">Single Posts</option><option value=\"ARCHIVE\">Archive Pages</option><option value=\"SEARCH_RESULTS\">Search Results</option><option value=\"ERROR_404\">404 Error Page</option></select></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>",
  "spacer": "<div class=\"space-y-3 pt-2 border-t border-slate-100\"><h3 class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-600 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span>↕️</span> Spacer Settings</h3><div><label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Height (px)</label><input min=\"5\" max=\"400\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono\" type=\"number\" value=\"40\"></div></div>",
  "divider": "<div class=\"space-y-3 pt-2 border-t border-slate-100\"><h3 class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span>➖</span> Divider Settings</h3><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\"><div><label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Style</label><select class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium\"><option value=\"solid\">Solid Line</option><option value=\"dashed\">Dashed</option><option value=\"dotted\">Dotted</option><option value=\"double\">Double Line</option></select></div><div><label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Thickness (px)</label><input min=\"1\" max=\"20\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono\" type=\"number\" value=\"2\"></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\"><div><label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Color</label><input class=\"h-8 w-full rounded cursor-pointer border border-slate-300 p-0.5\" type=\"color\" value=\"#cbd5e1\"></div><div><label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Width (%)</label><input placeholder=\"100% or 500px\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono\" type=\"text\" value=\"100%\"></div></div></div>",
  "counter": "<div class=\"space-y-3 pt-2 border-t border-slate-100\"><h3 class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-600 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span>🔢</span> Counter Settings</h3><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\"><div><label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Starting Value</label><input class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono\" type=\"number\" value=\"0\"></div><div><label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Ending Value</label><input class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono\" type=\"number\" value=\"100\"></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\"><div><label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Prefix String</label><input placeholder=\"$ or #\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"></div><div><label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Suffix String</label><input placeholder=\"+ or %\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\"><div><label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Animation Duration (ms)</label><input step=\"100\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono\" type=\"number\" value=\"2000\"></div><div><label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Title Label</label><input placeholder=\"Happy Customers\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"></div></div></div>",
  "rating": "<div class=\"space-y-3 pt-2 border-t border-slate-100\"><h3 class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-500 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span>⭐</span> Rating Settings</h3><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\"><div><label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Rating Score</label><input step=\"0.1\" min=\"0\" max=\"5\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono\" type=\"number\" value=\"4.8\"></div><div><label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Scale Max</label><select class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium\"><option value=\"5\">5 Stars</option><option value=\"10\">10 Stars</option></select></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\"><div><label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Star Icon Color</label><input class=\"h-8 w-full rounded cursor-pointer border border-slate-300 p-0.5\" type=\"color\" value=\"#f59e0b\"></div><div><label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Show Numerical Score</label><select class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium\"><option value=\"true\">Yes</option><option value=\"false\">No</option></select></div></div></div>",
  "alert": "<div class=\"space-y-3 pt-2 border-t border-slate-100\"><h3 class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-rose-600 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span>🔔</span> Alert Settings</h3><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\"><div><label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Alert Variant</label><select class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800\"><option value=\"info\">ℹ️ Info (Blue)</option><option value=\"success\">✅ Success (Green)</option><option value=\"warning\">⚠️ Warning (Yellow)</option><option value=\"danger\">🚨 Danger (Red)</option></select></div><div><label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Dismissible Close</label><select class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium\"><option value=\"true\">Yes</option><option value=\"false\">No</option></select></div></div><div><label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Alert Title</label><input class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium\" type=\"text\" value=\"Notice\"></div><div><label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\">Alert Message</label><textarea rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"Detailed alert message...\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">Heads up</textarea></div></div>"
